OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,FFootball teams have paid tribute to
OL,7,Fformer midfielder Quevin Castro, who
OL,8,Fdied aged 25, during a match in
OL,9,FPortugal.
OL,11,FCastro collapsed during a friendly
OL,12,Fmatch between his current club, third-
OL,13,Ftier Portuguese side Real Sport Clube,
OL,14,Fand Estrela da Amadora on Saturday and
OL,15,Flater died in hospital.
OL,17,FThe midfielder was born in Portugal
OL,18,Fbut grew up in Thetford, Norfolk,
OL,19,Fwhere he played for his local team and
OL,20,Fothers in Suffolk and Cambridge.
