OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787933963
OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,FThetford Town FC said: "It's a very
OL,7,Fsad time for the Town and the club. A
OL,8,Fbig loss taken to soon from the game
OL,9,Fwe all love."
OL,11,FThe team plans to hold a minutes
OL,12,Fsilence at Tuesday night's home game
OL,13,Fto remember their former player.
OL,15,FCambridge City Football Club said: "We
OL,16,Fare devastated to hear that our former
OL,17,Fplayer Quevin Castro has passed away
OL,18,Faged just 25.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/7
