OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787933963
OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,F"The thoughts and prayers of everyone
OL,7,Fat Cambridge City are with Quevin's
OL,8,Ffamily and friends at this terrible
OL,9,Ftime."
OL,11,FKings Lynn Town FC said: "Everyone at
OL,12,FKing's Lynn Town is saddened by the
OL,13,Ftragic passing of former midfielder
OL,14,FQuevin Castro at the age of 25.
OL,16,F"Our deepest condolences are with
OL,17,FQuevin's family and friends at this
OL,18,Ftime."
