OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1787933963
OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,FAfter starting his career in East
OL,7,FAnglia, Castro made his first-team
OL,8,Fdebut for the Baggies against Arsenal
OL,9,Fin the Carabao Cup in 2021 and made
OL,10,Fone league appearance for them the
OL,11,Ffollowing February.
OL,13,FWest Brom said: "West Brom are
OL,14,Fdevastated to learn of the untimely
OL,15,Fpassing of Quevin Castro, aged just 25.
OL,17,F"Albion will pay tribute to Quevin on
OL,18,FSunday, with a period of applause in
OL,19,Fthe 25th minute of the fixture against
OL,20,FBurnley. James Morrison's men will
OL,21,Falso wear black armbands."
