OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,FThe club added: "The thoughts of
OL,7,Feveryone at Albion are with Quevin's
OL,8,Floved ones at this desperately sad
OL,9,Ftime."
OL,11,FHe had loan spells at Burton, Notts
OL,12,FCounty and Gateshead before joining
OL,13,FYork in the summer of 2023 and, after
OL,14,Fmaking 15 appearances in total for the
OL,15,FMinstermen, he returned to Portugal.
