OL,3,CTributes paid to former footballer
OL,4,CQuevin Castro, who died aged 25
OL,6,FReal Sport Clube's opponents on
OL,7,FSaturday, Estrela da Amadora, said in
OL,8,Fa statement: "Estrela da Amadora
OL,9,Fhereby express their deepest sorrow
OL,10,Ffor the passing of Quevin Castro,
OL,11,Fplayer for Real Massama (Real Sport
OL,12,FClube).
OL,14,F"At this moment of profound sadness,
OL,15,FEstrela da Amadora extend their most
OL,16,Fheartfelt condolences to the family
OL,17,Fand friends of Quevin Castro, as well
OL,18,Fas to the entire Real Massama
OL,19,Fstructure.
